<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.recipe.trues ~ every wiki's floor stacks lares; the herm/hearth wiki's stacks lararium too

`lares wiki true-floor <slug>` trues one recipe to the canon floor by place: every wiki's floor stacks `lares`, the herm/hearth wiki's stacks `lararium` and `lares`. The door drops the libraries the rule withholds and prints the receipt the record keeps (`floor-trued-from`); a recipe already true answers `already-true` and changes nothing.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ true

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`true` params=`slug/works ~ true one recipe's floor`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ slug

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slug` params=`takes/slug needs/required seat/1 as/<slug> ~ the wiki slug`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ vessel

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`vessel` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the daemon verb runs under the vessel's own did; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.recipe.trues slug/works]] ~ name the slug`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-refused` params=`~ the daemon's true-floor verb refused; its message rides the line, exit 4`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ trued

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`trued` params=`exit/0 fields/[[dropped stack]] ~ what dropped and the stack after; already-true moves nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares wiki true-floor

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares wiki true-floor]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

